@apiBaseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/health

### Create upload session
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/call-recordings/upload-sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "sample-call.m4a",
  "contentType": "audio/mp4",
  "fileSize": 1024,
  "uploadConsent": true,
  "source": "android_manual",
  "tenantId": "local-tenant",
  "userId": "local-user"
}

### Complete upload
@recordingId = rec_replace_me
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/call-recordings/{{recordingId}}/complete

### Recent uploads
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/call-recordings/recent
